### Test Onboarding Data Flow - Before Registration
### This test demonstrates the correct flow: onboarding -> registration -> login

### Step 1: Save onboarding data BEFORE registration (no authentication)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/onboarding/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pregnancy_status": "pregnant",
  "last_period": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "cycle_length": 28,
  "period_length": 5,
  "pregnancy_week": 12,
  "pregnancy_progress": "first_trimester",
  "health_goals": "{\"track_period\": true, \"cycle_insights\": true, \"pregnancy_tracking\": true}",
  "notifications": true
}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "sessionId": "abc123sessionid",
#   "expiresAt": "2025-10-13T11:58:00.000Z"
# }

### Step 2: Complete onboarding with registration (using sessionId from step 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/onboarding/{{sessionId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "onboarding-flow@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567896"
}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "message": "Onboarding completed successfully",
#   "user": {
#     "id": 1,
#     "email": "onboarding-flow@example.com",
#     "phone": "+1234567896",
#     "isVerified": false
#   },
#   "onboardingData": {
#     "pregnancy_status": "pregnant",
#     "last_period": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
#     "cycle_length": 28,
#     "period_length": 5,
#     "pregnancy_week": 12,
#     "pregnancy_progress": "first_trimester",
#     "health_goals": "{\"track_period\": true, \"cycle_insights\": true, \"pregnancy_tracking\": true}",
#     "notifications": true
#   }
# }

### Step 3: Verify email (replace with actual verification code)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "onboarding-flow@example.com",
  "verify_code": "123456"
}

### Step 4: Login to get access token and verify onboarding data is included
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "onboarding-flow@example.com"
}

### Expected Login Response with Onboarding Data:
# {
#   "accessToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
